  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The application fails to provide precise product specifications, manufacturer datasheets, visual representations, or physical material samples for the proposed replacement non-combustible external materials. In the absence of this information, it cannot be established as a matter of fact that replacing natural timber balcony elements and remediating brick slip panels directly adjacent to existing brickwork would maintain a like-for-like appearance without altering the visual character, texture, tone, or finish of the building.&amp;nbsp; Therefore, the works constitute &quot;development&quot; under Section 55 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990, requiring planning permission.&lt;/p&gt;"
